Approval Workflow 

All voucher postings created by TCSGLIF to be approved by 3 approvers (1 TCSGLIF and 2 SBIGLIF). 

In case vouchers created by any other role, to be approved by 4 approvers (2 TCSGLIF and 2 SBIGLIF). 

Once approved by Last approver, the voucher will get posted. If execution schedule time is provided it will be executed on or after the scheduled time, else immediately. In case if the scheduled time is passed at the time of Final approval, it will be posted immediately. 

The voucher’s life cycle will end when a voucher posting is rejected by any approver. 

The users involved in workflow will get the notification of the voucher approval, rejection and schedule change. 

Comments are mandatory while approving or rejecting the request. 

The Maker and Last approver will have option to schedule the time of voucher posting. In case when Last approver schedules the execution time, it will override the scheduled time in case if it was provided by the Maker of the request. 

Maker will have an option to cancel the vouchers created by him, before Approver accepts/rejects. Upon cancelling the vouchers, RVID can be used again. 

No individual can approve the same voucher twice. 
No individual can approve the vouchers created by himself. 

